# Hourly Google Postmaster Tools sweep.
# Two roles in one script:
#   1. trafficStats pull (idempotent upsert on (domain, date) - no harm running
#      hourly even though Google publishes once per day)
#   2. CRM lifecycle handoff: shards in pending_verify status need their
#      gpt_status flipped to 'verified' as soon as Google's domains.list
#      reports them - operator can register a domain and see it transition
#      in <= 60 min instead of waiting until tomorrow's 07:00 cron.
0 * * * * /usr/local/bin/python /app/gpt-poller/poll.py
